//! tr kodlu 2 dil=en
// Error 04 — Undefined name.
// Message code: H1010
// What happens: The type checker catches the error before the program runs and suggests a similar name.
// Why: The name used was never defined or is misspelled.
// Fixed version:
//     var total_amount = 40
//     print(total_amount)
// Run (from the project root): tr examples/en/errors/04_undefined_name.tr   (exit code 1)

A030 total_amount = 40
G100(total_amout)
